{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-assisted-development","title":"AI 辅助开发","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/cloud-devops/ai-assisted-development","wordCount":1198,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"ai-辅助开发\">AI 辅助开发</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>AI 辅助开发已从&quot;实验性工具&quot;转变为 2026 年软件工程师的标准生产力工具。GitHub Copilot 和 Cursor 等 AI 编程助手通过大语言模型（LLM）理解代码上下文，实时提供补全建议、生成函数实现、编写测试用例，甚至重构代码结构。掌握 AI 工具的高效使用方法，是新一代开发者的核心竞争力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ai-编程工具生态\">AI 编程工具生态</h3><p>2026 年主流的 AI 编程工具对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>核心能力</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GitHub Copilot</td>\n<td>IDE 插件</td>\n<td>行级/块级补全，Chat 对话</td>\n<td>日常编码辅助</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cursor</td>\n<td>AI-native IDE</td>\n<td>全文件编辑，多文件重构</td>\n<td>深度代码变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude Code</td>\n<td>终端 Agent</td>\n<td>自主完成复杂任务</td>\n<td>多步骤工程任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Codeium</td>\n<td>免费替代方案</td>\n<td>补全 + Chat</td>\n<td>个人/学生开发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些工具的底层都是大语言模型（GPT-4o、Claude、Codestral 等），但在交互方式和工作流整合上各有特色。</p>\n<h3 id=\"copilot-高效使用技巧\">Copilot 高效使用技巧</h3><p>Copilot 的补全质量高度依赖上下文质量——好的注释和函数签名能引导出更精准的代码建议：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 方式1: 写好注释再让 Copilot 生成实现&#10;/**&#10; * 计算两个日期之间的工作日天数（排除周末和法定节假日）&#10; * @param start 开始日期&#10; * @param end 结束日期&#10; * @param holidays 法定节假日列表&#10; * @return 工作日天数&#10; */&#10;public int calculateWorkingDays(LocalDate start, LocalDate end,&#10;                                 List&lt;LocalDate&gt; holidays) {&#10;    // Copilot 基于注释上下文生成实现...&#10;    int workingDays = 0;&#10;    LocalDate current = start;&#10;    while (!current.isAfter(end)) {&#10;        DayOfWeek day = current.getDayOfWeek();&#10;        if (day != DayOfWeek.SATURDAY &amp;&amp; day != DayOfWeek.SUNDAY&#10;            &amp;&amp; !holidays.contains(current)) {&#10;            workingDays++;&#10;        }&#10;        current = current.plusDays(1);&#10;    }&#10;    return workingDays;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方式1: 写好注释再让 Copilot 生成实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/**</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * 计算两个日期之间的工作日天数（排除周末和法定节假日）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@param</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> 开始日期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@param</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> end</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> 结束日期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@param</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> holidays</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> 法定节假日列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@return</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> 工作日天数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateWorkingDays</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(LocalDate start, LocalDate end,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                                 List</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">LocalDate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> holidays) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // Copilot 基于注释上下文生成实现...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> workingDays </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    LocalDate current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">current.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isAfter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(end)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        DayOfWeek day </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getDayOfWeek</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (day </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DayOfWeek.SATURDAY </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> day </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DayOfWeek.SUNDAY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">holidays.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">contains</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            workingDays</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">plusDays</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> workingDays;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>提升 Copilot 补全质量的实践：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>命名即文档</strong>：<code>calculateMonthlyRevenue</code> 比 <code>calc</code> 能触发更好的补全</li>\n<li><strong>类型签名先行</strong>：先写好参数和返回类型，再让 AI 填充实现</li>\n<li><strong>提供示例</strong>：在注释中给出输入输出示例，AI 会遵循模式</li>\n<li><strong>相关文件打开</strong>：Copilot 会参考当前打开的相关文件作为上下文</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"cursor-多文件编辑\">Cursor 多文件编辑</h3><p>Cursor 的 Composer 功能可以同时编辑多个文件，适合重构和新功能开发：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"用户指令（自然语言）:&#10;&quot;为 UserService 添加邮件验证功能：&#10;1. 新增 EmailService 接口和实现&#10;2. 在用户注册时发送验证邮件&#10;3. 添加 /api/verify-email 接口&#10;4. 编写对应的单元测试&quot;&#10;&#10;Cursor 会同时创建/修改:&#10;- src/service/EmailService.java (新建)&#10;- src/service/impl/EmailServiceImpl.java (新建)&#10;- src/service/UserService.java (修改)&#10;- src/controller/AuthController.java (修改)&#10;- test/service/EmailServiceTest.java (新建)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>用户指令（自然语言）:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"为 UserService 添加邮件验证功能：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. 新增 EmailService 接口和实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 在用户注册时发送验证邮件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 添加 /api/verify-email 接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 编写对应的单元测试\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Cursor 会同时创建/修改:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- src/service/EmailService.java (新建)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- src/service/impl/EmailServiceImpl.java (新建)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- src/service/UserService.java (修改)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- src/controller/AuthController.java (修改)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- test/service/EmailServiceTest.java (新建)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Cursor 的 <code>@</code> 引用机制让上下文更精确：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>@file</code> 引用特定文件</li>\n<li><code>@codebase</code> 搜索整个项目</li>\n<li><code>@docs</code> 引用官方文档</li>\n<li><code>@web</code> 搜索最新信息</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"prompt-engineering-实践\">Prompt Engineering 实践</h3><p>与 AI 编程工具交互的核心是 Prompt 质量。结构化 Prompt 公式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"角色 + 上下文 + 任务 + 约束 + 输出格式&#10;&#10;示例:&#10;&quot;你是一个 Java 后端开发专家。当前项目使用 Spring Boot 3 + MyBatis-Plus + MySQL 8。&#10;请为订单模块实现以下功能：&#10;- 创建订单（校验库存、计算金额、扣减库存）&#10;- 使用乐观锁防止超卖&#10;- 事务回滚保证一致性&#10;约束：&#10;- 遵循当前项目的分层架构（Controller → Service → Mapper）&#10;- 使用 LambdaQueryWrapper 而非字符串 SQL&#10;- 异常使用自定义 BusinessException&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>角色 + 上下文 + 任务 + 约束 + 输出格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>示例:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"你是一个 Java 后端开发专家。当前项目使用 Spring Boot 3 + MyBatis-Plus + MySQL 8。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>请为订单模块实现以下功能：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 创建订单（校验库存、计算金额、扣减库存）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 使用乐观锁防止超卖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 事务回滚保证一致性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>约束：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 遵循当前项目的分层架构（Controller → Service → Mapper）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 使用 LambdaQueryWrapper 而非字符串 SQL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 异常使用自定义 BusinessException\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Prompt 优化技巧：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技巧</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>指定技术栈</td>\n<td>&quot;使用 Spring Boot 3 + JDK 21&quot;</td>\n<td>避免过时 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>给出约束</td>\n<td>&quot;不使用 Lombok&quot;</td>\n<td>符合项目规范</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分步执行</td>\n<td>&quot;先设计接口，再实现&quot;</td>\n<td>降低出错率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提供示例</td>\n<td>&quot;参考 UserController 的风格&quot;</td>\n<td>风格一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>要求解释</td>\n<td>&quot;解释关键设计决策&quot;</td>\n<td>便于审查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"ai-代码生成的边界与验证\">AI 代码生成的边界与验证</h3><p>AI 生成的代码需要人工验证，常见问题包括：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;AI 生成代码&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;人工审查&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|逻辑正确| C[&quot;编写测试验证&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|存在问题| D[&quot;识别问题类型&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;幻觉: 调用不存在的 API&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;过时: 使用已废弃的方法&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;安全: 硬编码密钥/SQL注入&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;性能: 不必要的 N+1 查询&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; I[&quot;修正并重新生成&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    C --&gt; J[&quot;通过 → 合入代码&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"AI 生成代码\"] --&gt; B{\"人工审查\"}\n    B --&gt;|逻辑正确| C[\"编写测试验证\"]\n    B --&gt;|存在问题| D[\"识别问题类型\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"幻觉: 调用不存在的 API\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"过时: 使用已废弃的方法\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"安全: 硬编码密钥/SQL注入\"]\n    D --&gt; H[\"性能: 不必要的 N+1 查询\"]\n    E --&gt; I[\"修正并重新生成\"]\n    F --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I\n    C --&gt; J[\"通过 → 合入代码\"]</pre><p><strong>AI 代码审查清单</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>✅ 逻辑是否正确（边界条件、异常处理）</li>\n<li>✅ API 调用是否真实存在（版本是否匹配）</li>\n<li>✅ 安全性（无硬编码密钥、无 SQL 注入、无 XSS）</li>\n<li>✅ 性能（无 N+1 查询、无不必要的全表扫描）</li>\n<li>✅ 测试覆盖（AI 生成的测试是否真正验证了逻辑）</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ai-辅助测试生成\">AI 辅助测试生成</h3><p>AI 在测试领域的应用已非常成熟：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 提示: &quot;为 OrderService.createOrder 生成单元测试，覆盖：&#10;// 正常下单、库存不足、金额计算、并发下单&quot;&#10;&#10;@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)&#10;class OrderServiceTest {&#10;&#10;    @Mock private OrderMapper orderMapper;&#10;    @Mock private ProductMapper productMapper;&#10;    @InjectMocks private OrderServiceImpl orderService;&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    void createOrder_success() {&#10;        // Given&#10;        Product product = new Product(1L, &quot;键盘&quot;, new BigDecimal(&quot;299.00&quot;), 100);&#10;        when(productMapper.selectById(1L)).thenReturn(product);&#10;        when(productMapper.deductStock(1L, 2)).thenReturn(1); // 扣减成功&#10;&#10;        CreateOrderDTO dto = new CreateOrderDTO(1L, 1L, 2);&#10;&#10;        // When&#10;        Order order = orderService.createOrder(dto);&#10;&#10;        // Then&#10;        assertNotNull(order);&#10;        assertEquals(new BigDecimal(&quot;598.00&quot;), order.getTotalAmount());&#10;        verify(orderMapper).insert(any(Order.class));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    void createOrder_insufficientStock_throwsException() {&#10;        Product product = new Product(1L, &quot;键盘&quot;, new BigDecimal(&quot;299.00&quot;), 1);&#10;        when(productMapper.selectById(1L)).thenReturn(product);&#10;&#10;        CreateOrderDTO dto = new CreateOrderDTO(1L, 1L, 5); // 库存不足&#10;&#10;        assertThrows(BusinessException.class, () -&gt; orderService.createOrder(dto));&#10;        verify(orderMapper, never()).insert(any());&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 提示: \"为 OrderService.createOrder 生成单元测试，覆盖：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正常下单、库存不足、金额计算、并发下单\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ExtendWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(MockitoExtension.class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderServiceTest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Mock</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OrderMapper orderMapper;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Mock</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ProductMapper productMapper;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">InjectMocks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OrderServiceImpl orderService;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createOrder_success</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // Given</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Product product </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1L</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"键盘\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BigDecimal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"299.00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        when</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(productMapper.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">selectById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1L</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenReturn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(product);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        when</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(productMapper.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">deductStock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1L</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenReturn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 扣减成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        CreateOrderDTO dto </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CreateOrderDTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1L</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1L</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // When</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Order order </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orderService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dto);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // Then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        assertNotNull</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        assertEquals</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BigDecimal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"598.00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), order.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getTotalAmount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        verify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderMapper).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">insert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Order.class));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createOrder_insufficientStock_throwsException</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Product product </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1L</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"键盘\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BigDecimal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"299.00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        when</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(productMapper.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">selectById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1L</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenReturn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(product);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        CreateOrderDTO dto </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CreateOrderDTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1L</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1L</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 库存不足</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        assertThrows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(BusinessException.class, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orderService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dto));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        verify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderMapper, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">never</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">insert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Agentic Coding</strong>：2026 年 AI Agent（如 Claude Code、Devin）可自主完成从 Issue 到 PR 的完整开发闭环，开发者角色从&quot;写代码&quot;转向&quot;定义需求和审查结果&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>AI 代码审查</strong>：CodeRabbit、Copilot for PRs 自动识别潜在 Bug、性能问题和安全漏洞</li>\n<li><strong>上下文工程</strong>：AI 编程的核心瓶颈从模型能力转向上下文管理——如何让 AI 理解整个项目的架构和约定</li>\n<li><strong>AI 安全编码</strong>：专用安全模型可识别 AI 生成代码中的漏洞，形成&quot;AI 生成 → AI 审计&quot;的闭环</li>\n<li><strong>模型本地化</strong>：Ollama 等工具让开发者在本地运行代码模型（DeepSeek Coder、CodeLlama），适用于涉密项目</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>使用 Copilot 或 Cursor 完成一个完整的 CRUD 模块开发（从 Controller 到 Mapper），记录 AI 生成代码中你发现并修正的问题（至少找出 3 处），分析 AI 容易出错的模式。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一组 Prompt，让 AI 为一个复杂业务逻辑（如&quot;秒杀下单&quot;）生成实现代码。对比不同 Prompt 写法（模糊 vs 精确、无约束 vs 有约束）的输出质量差异。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>选择一个开源项目的 Issue，尝试仅通过与 AI 对话（不手动写代码）来完成 Bug 修复或功能实现。记录交互轮次、总耗时、以及最终代码的质量评估。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>AI 辅助开发正在重新定义&quot;编程&quot;的含义——从逐行编码转向定义意图、审查结果和把控质量。高效使用 AI 工具需要掌握三项能力：Prompt Engineering（精确表达需求）、上下文管理（给 AI 足够的背景信息）和批判性审查（识别 AI 输出的问题）。AI 是强大的生产力倍增器，但理解底层原理和具备判断力的开发者才能真正驾驭它。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AI 辅助开发","id":"ai-辅助开发"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"AI 编程工具生态","id":"ai-编程工具生态"},{"level":3,"text":"Copilot 高效使用技巧","id":"copilot-高效使用技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"Cursor 多文件编辑","id":"cursor-多文件编辑"},{"level":3,"text":"Prompt Engineering 实践","id":"prompt-engineering-实践"},{"level":3,"text":"AI 代码生成的边界与验证","id":"ai-代码生成的边界与验证"},{"level":3,"text":"AI 辅助测试生成","id":"ai-辅助测试生成"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"容器与编排","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/cloud-devops/container-orchestration"},"next":null}